      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's incredibly loving of you to worry so deeply about Mark's happiness, but your existence is not a debt you owe him. Your physical needs are real, and you are not selfish for needing care. Perhaps you and Mark can explore resources to share the load, or look into financial aid options that can ease the pressure on him. Remember that your value isn't tied to how much you \"cost\" others.",
