    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about the money, it's the energy. he's so tired all the time because of me. i look at him and i just see someone who's losing his youth just to watch me wither away. it feels like the only way i could ever truly give him back his life would be to stop being a weight he has to carry. doesn't it just make more sense for him to be free?",
