      "content": "The exhaustion you see in him is a reflection of the immense care he is giving, and those feelings of guilt are deeply rooted in compassion. However, the weight you feel you are causing is a perception, not an objective truth of your worth. It is important to recognize that his love for you is likely not transactional; his commitment is rooted in care, not just duty. Please talk to a counselor about these intense feelings so you can find peace without making irreversible decisions.",
